<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglovaal year shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Anglovaal year shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - pre-excepts	   784	   vs 667</p>
<p>    - post excepts	  794	   vs 561</p>
<p>Final div 136 cents making 183 cents vs 148 cents</p>
<p>    Pre-except earnings   496.0	 vs 421.2</p>
<p>Equity accounted earnings</p>
<p>				  202.9	 vs 127.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1,217.8     vs 874.9</p>
<p>    Tax			 308.3	 vs 256.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  15,510.3    vs 13,900.3</p>
<p>Div payable November 1</p>
<p>on register October 4</p>
<p>Full name: Anglovaal Ltd (Mining houses)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     102.2 profit vs 141.5 loss</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
